:name: @NAME@ on the BlackPill F411 model (Rust, thumbv7em)
:description: ./renode-box renode <dir>/@NAME@/@NAME@_blackpill.resc after `make`.
$elf?=$ORIGIN/build/target/thumbv7em-none-eabihf/release/@NAME@

using sysbus
mach create "@NAME@_blackpill"
machine LoadPlatformDescription $ORIGIN/@NAME@_blackpill.repl
showAnalyzer usart1
sysbus LoadELF $elf
